                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 border rounded p-2"><i class="fa fa-star-o text-muted"></i><span class="small flex-grow-1">Elektronik › TV › Televizyonlar › OLED TV</span><i class="fa fa-times text-danger"></i></div>
