                        <div class="card-header bg-light py-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><h6 class="mb-0"><i class="fa fa-align-left text-primary me-2"></i>Detaylı Açıklama</h6><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" type="button"><i class="fa fa-magic me-1"></i>AI ile Oluştur</button></div>
